    "detailed_description": "Immerse yourself in the strategic world of Hexagon Ultra, where hexagonal tiles set the stage for a thrilling clash between blue and red! Challenge your wits against an AI opponent, strategically moving your blue tiles to outmanoeuvre the enemy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRules: Command the blue tiles against the relentless red enemy. Strategically manipulate tiles to dominate the board and secure victory.<br />\r\nMove tiles to free neighbouring positions, initiating splits to create new tiles. Plan your moves wisely to shape the battlefield.<br />\r\nJump over tiles, change colours strategically, and adapt your strategy as the game unfolds to secure dominance.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nVictory Conditions: Fill the board with your tiles, outnumber the enemy, and emerge victorious. Watch as remaining positions succumb to the enemy colour if no moves are left.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTest your skills and experience the thrilling gameplay with 30+ levels.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore different environments and face off against unique enemy characters.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStay tuned for updates, featuring new level packs, game modes, environments, and entertaining characters.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHexagon Ultra is continuously evolving! Expect new game modes, environments, and characters to keep the excitement alive.",
    "about_the_game": "Immerse yourself in the strategic world of Hexagon Ultra, where hexagonal tiles set the stage for a thrilling clash between blue and red! Challenge your wits against an AI opponent, strategically moving your blue tiles to outmanoeuvre the enemy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRules: Command the blue tiles against the relentless red enemy. Strategically manipulate tiles to dominate the board and secure victory.<br />\r\nMove tiles to free neighbouring positions, initiating splits to create new tiles. Plan your moves wisely to shape the battlefield.<br />\r\nJump over tiles, change colours strategically, and adapt your strategy as the game unfolds to secure dominance.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nVictory Conditions: Fill the board with your tiles, outnumber the enemy, and emerge victorious. Watch as remaining positions succumb to the enemy colour if no moves are left.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTest your skills and experience the thrilling gameplay with 30+ levels.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore different environments and face off against unique enemy characters.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStay tuned for updates, featuring new level packs, game modes, environments, and entertaining characters.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHexagon Ultra is continuously evolving! Expect new game modes, environments, and characters to keep the excitement alive.",
    "short_description": "Hexagon Ultra is a classic 3D adaptation of a popular game: Ataxx. Turn-based board games in different environments against talking AI enemies. Fill the board, outnumber the enemy for triumph. More than 30 levels have their unique path to win!",
